From 76e3c5383b4ddc5f37a65f1ec47a620aa85b5202 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ari Wilson <ari.wilson@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:16:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add local appointment CSV export workspace

Give staff an inclusive date-range preview and spreadsheet-safe CSV download, with status filters, pagination, and a matching CLI. Keep exports on a separate loopback server and open the database read-only. Document current-catalog price semantics. Refs #1.
